			"Message": "refactor(Output): Update bundled artifacts and source modules\n\n- Minify Shared/Process/Proxy.js IIFE parameter names (no logic changes)\n- Add property access brackets in Identity.ts product replacement definitions\n- Add type annotations to Tauri main process service for VSCode event types\n\nNo functional or behavioral changes. Improves compression minification and type safety.",
